{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T LET HELL CONSUME OUR UNIVERSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to control unknow supernatural forces, Dr.Ashford newest invention ends by trapping his daugther Sarah, and using her as a Human Katalysator to bring hell on Earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an ancient evil threatens the orderly chaos of the universe, Dr.Ashford hires someone to fight against the endless horde of demons: Raven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/b41e48eff0f02a43f454884bc2d4eb61.avif?t=1761225489\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a little help from Dr. Ashford and some strange allies, Raven now needs to Reproduce and Capture 6 Elemental Powers: Light, Fire, Shadow, Uranium, Ice and Eletricity in order to reopen the portal and save Sarah. (and of course, the universe!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/f0db6ae60d1a16ad0970b7794f8589c0.avif?t=1761225489\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> ENDLESS CARNAGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of the universe is in your hands, so you don't need to play fair:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; The enemies will get stronger, and so will you. Have fun with ENDLESS UPGRADES. That's right! Any upgrade you make on your character attribute or gun can be re-upgraded endlessly, (of course, if you manage to buy them all)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt;\u00a0Find random items to increase your strategic chances against enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Every map (level) have it's own Main Quest, and each one of them has a Katalysator Elemental Power for you to unlock (and bring it to Dr.Ashford, of course.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Discover Secret Side Quests that rewards you with unique and special weapons, powers, new map areas and much more: Espectral Staffs, Magic Bows, Revolvers forged by demon blood, and much, MUCH MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691280/extras/e39a4a3a513429e42cc5eb99071094ba.avif?t=1761225489\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demon Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/8e987e55ece412c6ac7fc3bd716b1062a074af72.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/3339acb6f8259fd5e14dc45b3eb6b5ef4c974e3f.jpg"},{"name":"Demoniologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/77ce21a0c06fbdb9525ed1fb3f1f208d2848876e.jpg"},{"name":"Fetch me Their Souls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/c5ea48eca8062dfd7e0907378d354649a631c6a5.jpg"},{"name":"And then... Light!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/2c652459d28250f8dfff1dc98cb5a5c0b0bbb37e.jpg"},{"name":"Afterlife","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/5847d8c695bab3e410b2a9911ab353fc1a2cf09f.jpg"},{"name":"I've came prepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/7f0316ae9efb7a48463ddb1c6473dbd68ac197f5.jpg"},{"name":"My Favorite Perk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/8abd99d3b31fe51451f56cd10e8abe9b8b117d51.jpg"},{"name":"Bullets From Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691280/8b3c87acb5bc1b065b12a76d8bddfcb8a0